OL,3,GFEATURESCPast BBC cuts: the demise of
OL,4,CEnglish regional continuity
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile all of us who care about the BBC
OL,7,Fworry about its current problems, this
OL,8,Fweek provides a chance to reflect on a
OL,9,Fprevious round of cuts.
OL,11,FEnglish regional continuity disappeared
OL,12,Fin the early hours of 13th September
OL,13,F1980.
OL,15,FThe final regular closedown from BBC
OL,16,FOne North West enjoys something of a
OL,17,Fcult status amongst Pres fans.
OL,19,FThe end of English regional continuity
OL,20,Fwas one of a number of savings made by
OL,21,Fthe BBC in 1980.
OL,23,APub: 13-Sep-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1789329388
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCPast BBC cuts: the demise of
OL,4,CEnglish regional continuity
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost controversially some of the
OL,7,Fcorporation's in-house orchestras were
OL,8,Fdisbanded.
OL,10,FThis led to the famous Musician's Union
OL,11,Fstrike which kept Top of the Pops off
OL,12,Fthe air, silenced the Play School clock
OL,13,Fand led to an unexpected musical
OL,14,Faccompaniment from the picket line
OL,15,Fduring Saturday Night at the Mill.
OL,17,FBut it would be good to try to piece
OL,18,Ftogether the story of English regional
OL,19,Fcontinuity.
OL,23,APub: 13-Sep-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
