OL,3,GFEATURESCPast BBC cuts: the demise of
OL,4,CEnglish regional continuity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs far as we are aware, the English
OL,7,Fregions all began to cover weekday
OL,8,Fevening junctions in April 1976.
OL,10,FIt cost little. Announcers were already
OL,11,Fon duty for the late night regional
OL,12,Fnews and regional programmes.
OL,14,FThe breakthrough was the introduction
OL,15,Fof Presfax ` a system which allowed
OL,16,Fregional announcers to see exactly what
OL,17,Fnetwork was planning to say and do in
OL,18,Feach junction.
OL,20,FBut did full-time English regional
OL,21,Fcontinuity achieve much?
OL,23,APub: 13-Sep-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12104
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1789329388
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCPast BBC cuts: the demise of
OL,4,CEnglish regional continuity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe English regions normally broadcast
OL,7,Ftheir local programmes at specific,
OL,8,Fagreed times. They did not disrupt the
OL,9,Fschedules like Scotland and Northern
OL,10,FIreland. (BBC Wales practically ran a
OL,11,Fseparate schedule at times.)
OL,13,FIf the aim was to make the BBC feel
OL,14,Fmore friendly and local, a separate
OL,15,Fdisembodied voice probably did little
OL,16,Fto help.
OL,18,FThe graphics were generally poorer than
OL,19,Fthose on the network feed.
OL,23,APub: 13-Sep-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12105
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1789329388
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCPast BBC cuts: the demise of
OL,4,CEnglish regional continuity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe shoestring budget explains why
OL,7,Fthere was no local continuity at the
OL,8,Fweekends ` there were no late night
OL,9,Fnews summaries. On Saturdays the
OL,10,Fregions went home after the teatime
OL,11,Fsports bulletin.
OL,13,FIt would be interesting to know if all
OL,14,Fthe English regions introduced local
OL,15,Fcontinuity on the same day. Or was it
OL,16,Fphased in?
OL,18,FThe decision to scrap English regional
OL,19,Fcontinuity in 1980 must have been one
OL,20,Fof the easiest cuts the BBC has ever
OL,21,Fmade.
OL,23,APub: 13-Sep-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
