OL,3,GFEATURESCPast BBC cuts: the demise of
OL,4,CEnglish regional continuity
OL,5,
OL,6,FInterestingly, the loss of the late
OL,7,Fnight regional news was balanced out by
OL,8,Fthe introduction of a lunchtime
OL,9,Fbulletin a few months later.
OL,11,FThere are also sporadic examples of
OL,12,FEnglish regions using local symbols to
OL,13,Fintroduce network programmes up until
OL,14,Faround 1983 or 84. For instance,
OL,15,Fintroducing Play School after the
OL,16,Fafternoon regional headlines.
OL,18,FOne legacy remains though.
OL,23,APub: 13-Sep-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12107
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1789329388
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G7/7
