OL,3,GFEATURESCPast BBC cuts: the demise of
OL,4,CEnglish regional continuity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs far as we know, Scotland and
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland introduced full time
OL,8,Fevening continuity at the same time as
OL,9,Fthe English regions. Again this was
OL,10,Fthanks to Presfax and took advantage of
OL,11,Fstaff who were already on duty for opts
OL,12,Fand the late night news.
OL,14,FSo can any former announcers or Pres
OL,15,Fstaff help us put together the
OL,16,Fdefinitive story of an interesting but
OL,17,Fultimately unsuccessful experiment?
OL,23,APub: 13-Sep-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
